+# Self-weight native/Wasm adapter design v2 — source held for refutation
+
+New crate core/loads/self_weight_wasm with exact write fence Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/lib.rs. crate name open_pipe_stress_self_weight_wasm; cdylib + rlib. Dependencies product_physics (../../product_physics), canonical_json (../../serialization/canonical_json), serde_json 1, sha2 0.10, optional wasm-bindgen =0.2.123 behind wasm feature. No operation_applier dependency, no mass math, no solver/direct model mutation.
+
+Shared native public function `generate_plan(model: &serde_json::Value, request: &serde_json::Value) -> serde_json::Value`. Native N2 Tauri command and Wasm wrapper call this identical function. Wasm feature export `generate_self_weight_plan_json(model_json: &str, request_json: &str) -> String` parses JSON and returns same envelope; invalid JSON is a blocking diagnostic envelope, no panic/JS trap required. Module generator remains product_physics::self_weight::generate_self_weight_operations; adapter only authenticates original source hash, validates/deserializes projections and envelopes result.
+
+Request uses existing SelfWeightRequest fields. CORRECTION to PhaseB bare-hex wording: source_model_hash is exactly `sha256:<64 lowercase hex>`, matching operation_applier ModelHashBasis.backend_model_hash. Before deserializing PreviewModel compute `sha256:` + lowercase SHA256(shared canonical_json::canonical_json(original model Value)) and require exact source_model_hash equality. Missing/nonstring/malformed/mismatch blocks with no plan. This covers all original document fields, including unknown fields lost by typed projection. Never reconstruct original document from PreviewModel and never use hash of only selected pipes. No fake complete hash evidence generated for batch; PKG16 remains responsible for complete claim verification. Module child receives exact-format amendment.
+
+Response envelope fields always: document_kind='openpipestress.desktop.self_weight_plan_outcome', status='ready'|'blocked', input_model_unchanged=true, source_model_hash=authenticated computed prefixed hash or null if parsing/model invalid, plan=serialized SelfWeightOperationPlan only when ready otherwise null, diagnostics=array, mutation_route='structured_operations_only', requires_user_acceptance=true. This is proposal generation, never applied/accepted output; no acceptance receipt or applied_model field. Do not echo entire original model or untrusted request in errors. Pure plan preserves full source_evidence and draft source_note/provenance strings without relabeling author metadata.
+
+Blocking diagnostics have code, severity='blocking', message, remediation, affected_objects Vec<String>. Suggested codes SELF-WEIGHT-JSON-INVALID, SELF-WEIGHT-MODEL-SHAPE-INVALID, SELF-WEIGHT-REQUEST-SHAPE-INVALID, SELF-WEIGHT-SOURCE-HASH-MISMATCH, plus projection of module Diagnostic preserving its actual code/message/affected refs and adding explicit remediation. Validate JSON object shape; typed parse failures return diagnostics before generator. Native accepted Value cannot contain NaN; quantity overflow remains generator check. Every error returns plan=null and status blocked; successful result diagnostics empty.
+
+Tests: valid explicit request and exact canonical source hash produces expected drafts; changing an otherwise ignored model field with stale request hash blocks; wrong/missing hash, malformed native request/model and malformed Wasm JSON block; reordered JSON keys canonicalize identically; exact module output parity against shared generate_plan; wrapper common JSON parser helper tested natively; feature-target Wasm build and N1 actual native/Wasm consumer comparison remain integration checks. All unsuccessful responses contain no partial plan/model/receipt. No error text treats validation as approval.
+
+Ownership: PKG05 Agent2 new wrapper crate only after refutation PASS+parent release; existing module child unchanged. PKG05 fresh complete source review includes wrapper and generator owned diff; parent N2 Tauri manifest/command integration, N1 loader/build script extension and unavailable UI/error handling. Browser artifact remains a draft generator; operation_applier atomic batch remains sole mutation engine. Additional dependency/build changes prohibited until parent accepts this design. Existing lib.rs export already serialized manager-owned.
+
+## V2 refutation repair: strict generation options
+SelfWeightRequest accepts exactly case_id,label,pipe_refs,gravity,provenance,source_model_hash. SelfWeightGravity accepts exactly value,unit,axis. Both module Deserialize structs use serde deny_unknown_fields so direct module JSON parsing and adapter parsing share rejection semantics. Unknown option fields at either level produce request-shape blocking diagnostic, never ignored or guessed. Native typed construction still has only defined fields. Unknown original MODEL fields remain retained in original Value and included in canonical source hash; PreviewModel's intentional projection is not tightened. Tests cover both unknown request/gravity fields and ignored model field stale-hash detection.
